  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d12f67820ba484488a4e5e3be56da97e, type: 3}
  itemDescription: "Waste Management and Recycling Technologies Institute  This institute
    works on waste management solutions to support environmental sustainability and
    a circular economy. Its focus is on recycling technologies, waste-to-energy processes,
    and safe waste disposal methods. Research areas include solid waste sorting and
    recycling (plastics, metals, paper), converting waste to fuels or electricity
    (biomass and municipal solid waste incineration with energy recovery), and hazardous
    waste treatment. The institute\u2019s mission is to reduce landfill usage by
    maximizing recycling and resource recovery, thereby turning waste streams into
    economic assets and minimizing environmental pollution"
